summary.ko:
터치 효과 컴포넌트.
- 원본 misc/toucheffect.js 를 옮긴 것이다. 누른 자리에 하늘색 빛 입자를 흩뿌리고 0.4 초 동안 흐려지며 퍼지게 한다.
- 입자는 흰색 방사형 그라디언트 그림(64x64, 한 번만 만든다)을 하늘색(rgb 100, 200, 255)으로 틴트하고 더하기(lighter) 블렌드로 그린다.
- 사용:
  ```text
    let touch_effect_id = node_tree.create_child(root_id, "TouchEffect");
    node_tree[touch_effect_id].set_pivot(Pivot::TOP_LEFT);
    node_tree[touch_effect_id].add_component(TouchEffect::new());
    // 누를 때: node_tree[touch_effect_id].get_component_mut::<TouchEffect>().unwrap().create_touch_particle(x, y);
  ```
- 원본과 다른 점:
  원본은 WorldNode 를 상속한 노드이고, 러스트 판은 노드에 붙는 컴포넌트다. 블렌드는 원본처럼 push_transform 에서 더하기로 바꾸고
  pop_transform 에서 앞의 블렌드로 되돌려 자식까지 더하기로 그린다. (컴포넌트의 노드 출력 상태 앞뒤 훅)
  그라디언트는 원본처럼 오프스크린 캔버스(엔진 Canvas2D)의 방사 그라디언트로 구운 Image 다.

summary.en:
Touch effect component.
- A port of the original misc/toucheffect.js. Scatters sky blue light particles at the press point that fade and spread over 0.4 seconds.
- Particles draw a white radial gradient image (64x64, made only once) tinted sky blue (rgb 100, 200, 255) with additive (lighter) blending.
- Usage:
  ```text
    let touch_effect_id = node_tree.create_child(root_id, "TouchEffect");
    node_tree[touch_effect_id].set_pivot(Pivot::TOP_LEFT);
    node_tree[touch_effect_id].add_component(TouchEffect::new());
    // on press: node_tree[touch_effect_id].get_component_mut::<TouchEffect>().unwrap().create_touch_particle(x, y);
  ```
- Differences from the original:
  The original is a node that inherits WorldNode, and the Rust version is a component attached to a node. As in the original, the blend is switched to additive in push_transform
  and restored to the previous blend in pop_transform, so children are drawn additively too. (the component's hooks around the node draw state)
  The gradient is an Image baked with the radial gradient of an offscreen canvas (the engine Canvas2D), like the original.

examples.code:
use vanilla::{TouchParticle, Vector2};

let mut particle = TouchParticle::new();
particle.position = Vector2::create(40.0, 30.0);
particle.radius = 20.0;
assert_eq!(particle.life, particle.max_life);
assert_eq!(particle.velocity, Vector2::zero());

use vanilla::{NodeTree, Pivot, TouchEffect};

let mut node_tree = NodeTree::new();
let root_id = node_tree.get_root_id();
let touch_effect_id = node_tree.create_child(root_id, "TouchEffect");
node_tree[touch_effect_id].set_pivot(Pivot::TOP_LEFT);
node_tree[touch_effect_id].add_component(TouchEffect::new());

let touch_effect = node_tree[touch_effect_id].get_component_mut::<TouchEffect>().unwrap();
touch_effect.create_touch_particle(120.0, 80.0);
assert_eq!(touch_effect.get_particle_count(), 1);
touch_effect.update_touch_particles(0.5);
assert_eq!(touch_effect.get_particle_count(), 0);

summary.ko:
타자기 연출기.
- 원본 misc/typewriter.js 를 옮긴 것이다. Text 처럼 보일 글자 수를 정할 수 있는 대상의 글자를 초당 정한 속도로 한 자씩 드러낸다.
  (비주얼노벨 / RPG 대사 연출)
- 사용:
  ```text
    let mut typewriter = Typewriter::new(TypewriterOptions { characters_per_second: 30.0, ..TypewriterOptions::default() });
    let label = node_tree[label_id].get_component_mut::<Text>().unwrap();
    typewriter.start(label, Some("안녕하세요. 모험을 시작합니다."));
    // 매 프레임: typewriter.tick(label, time_delta);
    // 입력에서: 끝났으면(typewriter.is_finished()) 다음 대사로, 아니면 typewriter.skip_to_end(label)
  ```
- 원본과 다른 점:
  원본은 대상을 생성자에서 받아 들고 있는다. 러스트 판은 노드 안의 컴포넌트를 들고 있을 수 없어서
  start / tick / skip_to_end 때마다 대상(&mut dyn TypewriterTarget)을 넘긴다. Text 는 TypewriterTarget 을 구현한다.
  글자 수는 원본처럼 글자 묶음(받침, 결합 부호, 이모지 묶음을 한 자로) 단위로 센다. 글자 공개 알림은 (글자 묶음, 번호) 를 받는다.
  options 객체는 TypewriterOptions 구조체다.

summary.en:
Typewriter effect.
- A port of the original misc/typewriter.js. Reveals the text of a target that can set its visible character count, like Text, one character at a time at a set speed per second.
  (visual novel / RPG dialogue presentation)
- Usage:
  ```text
    let mut typewriter = Typewriter::new(TypewriterOptions { characters_per_second: 30.0, ..TypewriterOptions::default() });
    let label = node_tree[label_id].get_component_mut::<Text>().unwrap();
    typewriter.start(label, Some("Hello. The adventure begins."));
    // every frame: typewriter.tick(label, time_delta);
    // on input: next line if finished (typewriter.is_finished()), otherwise typewriter.skip_to_end(label)
  ```
- Differences from the original:
  The original takes the target in the constructor and holds it. The Rust version cannot hold a component inside a node, so
  the target (&mut dyn TypewriterTarget) is passed on every start / tick / skip_to_end. Text implements TypewriterTarget.
  As in the original, characters are counted in grapheme clusters (final consonants, combining marks, and emoji sequences count as one). The character reveal notification receives (grapheme cluster, index).
  The options object is the TypewriterOptions struct.

examples.code:
use vanilla::{Typewriter, TypewriterOptions, TypewriterTarget};

struct CountingLabel {
	text: String,
	visible_character_count: i32,
}

impl TypewriterTarget for CountingLabel {
	fn set_text(&mut self, text: &str) {
		self.text = text.to_string();
	}

	fn get_text(&self) -> &str {
		&self.text
	}

	fn set_visible_character_count(&mut self, visible_character_count: i32) {
		self.visible_character_count = visible_character_count;
	}
}

let mut label = CountingLabel {
	text: String::new(),
	visible_character_count: -1,
};
let mut typewriter = Typewriter::new(TypewriterOptions {
	characters_per_second: 10.0,
	..TypewriterOptions::default()
});
typewriter.start(&mut label, Some("hello"));
typewriter.tick(&mut label, 0.25);
assert_eq!(label.visible_character_count, 2);

use vanilla::{Typewriter, TypewriterOptions};

let typewriter_options = TypewriterOptions {
	characters_per_second: 20.0,
	..TypewriterOptions::default()
};
assert_eq!(typewriter_options.fast_forward_multiplier, 8.0);
let typewriter = Typewriter::new(typewriter_options);
assert!(typewriter.is_finished());

use std::cell::RefCell;
use std::rc::Rc;
use vanilla::{Text, Typewriter, TypewriterOptions};

let revealed_list = Rc::new(RefCell::new(Vec::new()));
let revealed_list_for_event = revealed_list.clone();
let mut label = Text::new();
let mut typewriter = Typewriter::new(TypewriterOptions {
	characters_per_second: 10.0,
	..TypewriterOptions::default()
});
typewriter.set_character_revealed_event(move |character, character_index| {
	revealed_list_for_event.borrow_mut().push((character.to_string(), character_index));
});
typewriter.start(&mut label, Some("abc"));
typewriter.tick(&mut label, 0.25);
assert_eq!(*revealed_list.borrow(), vec![(String::from("a"), 0), (String::from("b"), 1)]);

use vanilla::{NodeTree, Text, Typewriter, TypewriterOptions};

let mut node_tree = NodeTree::new();
let root_id = node_tree.get_root_id();
let label_id = node_tree.create_child(root_id, "label");
node_tree[label_id].add_component(Text::new());

let mut typewriter = Typewriter::new(TypewriterOptions {
	characters_per_second: 30.0,
	..TypewriterOptions::default()
});
let label = node_tree[label_id].get_component_mut::<Text>().unwrap();
typewriter.start(label, Some("Hello. The adventure begins."));
typewriter.tick(label, 0.1);
assert_eq!(label.get_visible_character_count(), 3);

if typewriter.is_finished() {
	typewriter.start(label, Some("Next line."));
}
else {
	typewriter.skip_to_end(label);
}
assert!(typewriter.is_finished());
assert_eq!(label.get_visible_character_count(), -1);

use std::cell::RefCell;
use std::rc::Rc;
use vanilla::{Vector2, VirtualPad, VirtualPadState};

let last_event = Rc::new(RefCell::new((Vector2::zero(), 0.0)));
let last_event_for_callback = last_event.clone();
let mut virtual_pad = VirtualPad::new();
virtual_pad.set_pad_radius(100.0);
virtual_pad.set_pad_position(Vector2::create(200.0, 200.0));
virtual_pad.set_ball_move_event(move |direction, pull_strength| {
	*last_event_for_callback.borrow_mut() = (direction, pull_strength);
});

virtual_pad.touch_press(Vector2::create(200.0, 200.0));
virtual_pad.touch_move(Vector2::create(500.0, 200.0));
virtual_pad.tick(1.0 / 60.0);
assert_eq!(virtual_pad.get_ball_position(), Vector2::create(300.0, 200.0));
assert_eq!(*last_event.borrow(), (Vector2::create(1.0, 0.5), 1.0));

virtual_pad.touch_release(Vector2::create(500.0, 200.0));
for _ in 0..10 {
	virtual_pad.tick(1.0 / 60.0);
}
assert_eq!(virtual_pad.get_virtual_pad_state(), VirtualPadState::None);
assert_eq!(*last_event.borrow(), (Vector2::create(0.5, 0.5), 0.0));

use vanilla::{NodeTree, UIDocument, Vector2, Visual};

let mut document = UIDocument::new();
let mut node_tree = NodeTree::new();
let mut visual = Visual::new();
assert_eq!(visual.create_node(&mut document, &mut node_tree), Ok(None));
visual.set_document_text(Some(String::from(r#"{"version":1}"#)));
assert!(visual.create_node(&mut document, &mut node_tree).is_err());

visual.set_document_text(Some(String::from(r#"{"version":1,"root":{"type":"WorldNode","name":"Coin","contentSize":[32,32],"components":[],"children":[]}}"#)));
let first_id = visual.create_node(&mut document, &mut node_tree).expect("document").expect("root");
visual.set_location(Vector2::create(48.0, 0.0));
let second_id = visual.create_node(&mut document, &mut node_tree).expect("document").expect("root");
assert_ne!(first_id, second_id);
assert_eq!(node_tree[second_id].get_name(), "Coin");
assert_eq!(node_tree[first_id].get_local_position().x, 0.0);
assert_eq!(node_tree[second_id].get_local_position().x, 48.0);
assert!(node_tree.get_parent_id(second_id).is_none());

use vanilla::{Component, NodeTree, UIDocument, Vector2, Visual};

let document_text = r#"{"version":1,"root":{"type":"WorldNode","name":"Badge","position":[300,200],"contentSize":[64,64],"components":[],"children":[]}}"#;
let mut visual = Visual::new();
visual.set_document_text(Some(document_text.to_string()));
visual.set_location(Vector2::create(40.0, 20.0));

let mut document = UIDocument::new();
let mut node_tree = NodeTree::new();
let parent_id = node_tree.create_node("parent");
let badge_id = visual.create_node(&mut document, &mut node_tree).expect("document").expect("root");
assert!(node_tree.add_child(parent_id, badge_id));
assert_eq!(node_tree[badge_id].get_name(), "Badge");
assert_eq!(node_tree[badge_id].get_local_position(), Vector2::create(40.0, 20.0));
assert_eq!(node_tree.get_parent_id(badge_id), Some(parent_id));
assert_eq!(visual.get_component_type(), "Visual");

